WEBVTT

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:05.004
operational protocols that were woven
together with multi-sensory storytelling,

00:07:05.045 --> 00:07:08.841
whose singular purpose
was to create real value,

00:07:08.883 --> 00:07:10.926
driving real goodwill.

00:07:12.052 --> 00:07:16.056
The business plan fundamentally
had three concentric spirals

00:07:16.098 --> 00:07:17.266
underpinning it.

00:07:17.308 --> 00:07:18.434
So picture this.

00:07:18.476 --> 00:07:19.685
So first,

00:07:19.727 --> 00:07:21.854
we had the courage

00:07:21.896 --> 00:07:24.773
to establish a culture of kindness
in the workplace.

00:07:24.815 --> 00:07:26.275
Period, end of story.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:29.195
It was a strategic priority
day in, day out.

00:07:29.195 --> 00:07:32.281
And yeah, there were moments
as individuals we failed.